  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit Saline Futures Conference (MAP19MC03)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this incoming visit to the Saline Futures Conference is firstly to transfer knowledge of saline farming to the participating government officials and academics from the MENA region, and secondly to establish connections between Dutch companies and the participants.A goal of this visit is to invite a mixed group of influential persons in this sector: government officials, as well as companies and researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
